const HTML_B64 = "";
function decodeHtml(s){const bin=atob(s);const b=new Uint8Array(bin.length);for(let i=0;i<bin.length;i++)b[i]=bin.charCodeAt(i);return new TextDecoder("utf-8").decode(b);}
export default {async fetch(request){return new Response(decodeHtml(HTML_B64),{headers:{"Content-Type":"text/html; charset=utf-8","Cache-Control":"no-cache","X-Frame-Options":"DENY"}});}};